                    "description": "Account balance in the account's native currency (see the currency field). Its meaning depends on accountType: total account value including invested positions for Trading, Options, MoneyFarm, Spaceship and Plaee (for Plaee: cash plus the mark-to-market value of open prediction-market positions); holdings in native crypto units for Crypto; available cash for Cash. For Trading it equals equityDetails.available + equityDetails.totalUsedMargin + equityDetails.currentPNL. Not a spendable amount except on Cash accounts — see equityDetails.available.",
