      "tags": [
        "Social Feeds"
      ],
      "summary": "Update a reply",
      "description": "**Rate limit:** 60 requests per 60 seconds. This is the **default shared quota** — it is shared with every other endpoint that has no dedicated limit, so requests across those endpoints all draw from the same budget.\n\n---\n\nEdits the authenticated user's own reply in-place. Same semantics as updating a comment.",
